elling & Marketing Exp |         6.33 |         6.78 |         6.12 |         6.23 |\n| R&D Exp                 |        22.08 |        25.40 |        20.01 |        22.31 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |        34.74 |        29.77 |        28.61 |        30.73 |\n| Operating Income        |       -22.59 |       -14.41 |        10.17 |       -12.85 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |        -8.31 |        -4.73 |         2.42 |        -4.28 |\n| Net Income              |       -16.19 |        50.43 |        -4.13 |        10.57 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |        -5.96 |        16.54 |        -0.98 |         3.52 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |        21.18 |        71.73 |       -44.66 |       -28.89 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |       -19.75 |       175.17 |        -3.01 |       -14.50 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |         0.78 |       -81.92 |       181.24 |        -7.21 |\n| CAPEX                   |        -2.11 |        -0.31 |        -4.60 |        -9.53 |"
